#: classes/class-ssb-settings.php:339
#: classes/class-ssb-settings.php:496
msgid ""
"Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you set custom background, hover, and icon "
"colors for every button,\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tso they blend naturally with your website's design instead of "
"standing out like a default plugin.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tButtons that fit your site tend to get clicked more, which "
"means more shares and more traffic for you.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tPro also adds features like buttons on images, popups on exit "
"intent, fly in slide animations, and more."
msgstr ""
"Simple Social Buttons Pro giver dig mulighed for at indstille "
"brugerdefinerede baggrunds-, hover- og ikonfarver for hver knap,\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tså de smelter naturligt ind i dit websites design i stedet for "
"at skille sig ud som et standard plugin.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tKnapper, der passer til dit site, bliver klikket mere, hvilket "
"betyder flere delinger og mere trafik til dig.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tPro tilføjer også funktioner som knapper på billeder, popups "
"ved exit-intent, fly-in slide-animationer og mere."

